                <invention-title lang="de">ANPASSUNG EINER GRAFIKDARSTELLUNG AUF BASIS DES GESICHTSAUSDRUCKS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">RÉGLAGE DE RENDU GRAPHIQUE BASÉ SUR L'EXPRESSION FACIALE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ADJUSTING GRAPHICS RENDERING BASED ON FACIAL EXPRESSION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An embodiment of a graphics apparatus may include a facial expression detector to detect a facial expression of a user, and a parameter adjuster communicatively coupled to the facial expression detector to adjust a graphics parameter based on the detected facial expression of the user. The detected facial expression may include one or more of a squinting, blinking, winking, and facial muscle tension of the user. The graphics parameter may include one or more of a frame resolution, a screen contrast, a screen brightness, and a shading rate. Other embodiments are disclosed and claimed.</p>
            </abstract>
